        "created_at": "2013-05-02T21:39:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Reckless, I'm not so sure. &nbsp;Check out the workers in the background of the second pilot pic from today. &nbsp;And the guy being stared down on the sample Station card. &nbsp;And the waiter handing Almaric a drink. &nbsp;If there are variations in skin tone in this universe (possible, as you say) we haven't seen them.</p>",
