        "created_at": "2013-05-02T21:42:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think that it might still be early to write off the entire human species as ethnically homogeneous in the GSF universe just yet. Though I would agree that it might be sad if this ends up not being part of a deliberate and integral part of the human history of this world.</p>",
