      {
        "id": 62451,
        "name": "Reckless",
        "username": "Reckless",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-02T21:45:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'll give you that, but that same conclusion could be made from a lot of other works that have nothing but white characters in the future with little to no diversity.&nbsp; If it does turn out to be more homogenized, I'm cool with it.&nbsp; If this future has a Deltron 3030 vibe to it, I'm definitely not gonna complain.</p>",
