        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/benhimself/{size}/2160_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-03T11:16:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey, I'm the guy who made the kickstarter&nbsp;comment mentioned in the OP. Spiff hit the nail on the head with my intentions: I used \"black\"&nbsp;to mean \"of a dark skin color\" rather than the many valid&nbsp;ethnic/cultural/race-as-social-construct meanings of the term. I definitely meant no disrespect or offense in doing so, and if I caused any I apologize!</p>",
